questions.question:
After the api release, the analytics consumer crashed on every new event:

```ts
// analytics consumer, deployed weekly
const order = JSON.parse(message.value) as { orderId: string; deliveryAddress: string; total: number };
const district = order.deliveryAddress.split(",").at(-1)!.trim();
```

```text
# a new OrderPlaced event
{"orderId":"o-81231","restaurantId":"r-17","address":"12 Le Loi, District 1","total":185000,"tip":15000}

TypeError: Cannot read properties of undefined (reading 'split')
    at handleOrderPlaced (analytics/src/orders.ts:41:40)
```

Statement: "For a reader, renaming `deliveryAddress` to `address` is a removed field plus a new one: the consumer still reads `deliveryAddress`, which the new events no longer carry."
